  "body": "<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at e4a68daa02bcff9ce636ee12d3918e847245be09 -->\n\n## What's Changed\n### New Features\n* Draw image previews with the kitty graphics protocol by @babarot in https://github.com/babarot/gomi/pull/191\n### Bug fixes\n* Draw half blocks again when their pane changes size by @babarot in https://github.com/babarot/gomi/pull/193\n* Guard the lists of the test trash with a mutex by @babarot in https://github.com/babarot/gomi/pull/197\n### Improvements\n* Draw half blocks without pixterm by @babarot in https://github.com/babarot/gomi/pull/194\n* Measure directory sizes for the size filter in parallel by @babarot in https://github.com/babarot/gomi/pull/198\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/babarot/gomi/compare/v1.10.1...v1.11.0",
